Package: libmsp
Architecture: any
Section: libs
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: MultiWii Serial Protocol library (runtime)
 Implementation of the MultiWii Serial Protocol (MSP) for MultiWii,
 Cleanflight and Betaflight flight controllers. Provides a serial client and
 a higher-level flight controller API with publish/subscribe access to MSP
 messages.
 .
 This package provides the shared libraries.

Package: libmsp-dev
Architecture: any
Section: libdevel
Depends:
 libasio-dev,
 libmsp (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: MultiWii Serial Protocol library (development)
 Implementation of the MultiWii Serial Protocol (MSP) for MultiWii,
 Cleanflight and Betaflight flight controllers. Provides a serial client and
 a higher-level flight controller API with publish/subscribe access to MSP
 messages.
 .
 This package provides the headers and the pkg-config file.
 .
 libasio-dev is a hard dependency, not a build-time convenience: the installed
 msp/Client.hpp includes <asio.hpp> and exposes asio types in its interface, so
 anything that includes it needs asio present.

